# Close-out B1 (M2-G5): the campaign report builds next_cursor from the last row it RETURNED, never from the lookahead (page_size+1th) row it read to learn that another page exists. The fault anchors the cursor on the lookahead row again: the next page, which starts strictly after it, skips that item, one per page boundary, silently. The real route is walked page by page at several totals (not a multiple of the page size, an exact multiple, one page, page size 1) over real Postgres with created_at pairs that tie, and must return exactly the campaign's items, once each, in order. The unpatched control walks clean; the patched walk reports the missing item. Module 2's DB tests need a migrated template database, so the CMD builds one on the stock postgres service (the module's own migrate runner, as tests/harness/run.sh does) before running the single test.
GATE=m2-pagination
TARGET=module:coldmail-send-managed
SETUP=
STEP=go test TestCampaignReport_PaginationNoGapNoDuplicate (the real report route paged to exhaustion, real Postgres)
CMD=T=fp_m2_p2c_tpl; TPL="${FAULT_ADMIN_DSN%/*}/$T"; psql "$FAULT_ADMIN_DSN" -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 -q -c "DROP DATABASE IF EXISTS $T" -c "CREATE DATABASE $T" && psql "$TPL" -v ON_ERROR_STOP=1 -q -c "CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS public.users(id uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(), email text, is_active boolean default true, created_at timestamptz default now())" -c "CREATE TABLE IF NOT EXISTS public.job_items(id uuid primary key default gen_random_uuid(), campaign_id uuid, user_id uuid, recipient_email text, rendered_subject text, rendered_body text, reply_to text, status text, created_at timestamptz default now())" && (cd tools/send-managed-migrate && go build -o bin/send-managed-migrate .) && MIGRATE_DATABASE_URL="$TPL" SEND_MANAGED_MODULE_PASSWORD=devmodulepass tools/send-managed-migrate/bin/send-managed-migrate up-and-set-password && cd services/control && TEST_ADMIN_DATABASE_URL="$FAULT_ADMIN_DSN" TEST_TEMPLATE_DB="$T" SEND_MANAGED_MODULE_PASSWORD=devmodulepass go test -count=1 -v -run '^TestCampaignReport_PaginationNoGapNoDuplicate$' ./internal/platformapi/
MESSAGE=--- FAIL: TestCampaignReport_PaginationNoGapNoDuplicate
MESSAGE=MISSING (a gap)
